---
---

<section class="intro-section">
  <div class="container-site intro-inner">
    <div class="intro-col intro-col-left">
      <h2 class="intro-h2">Best House Cleaning in Australia</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="intro-col intro-col-right">
      <p class="intro-body">
        At NATURO GROUP, we believe a clean home should also be a healthy and sustainable one. Our eco-friendly cleaning services take the hassle out of maintaining a fresh, toxin-free home while being kind to the planet.
      </p>
      <p class="intro-body">
        With natural, non-toxic products and a meticulous approach, we help families across Australia enjoy a cleaner, greener living space &mdash; without compromising on sustainability.
      </p>
      <div class="intro-stats">
        <div class="intro-stat">
          <span class="intro-stat-num">Plant-based</span>
          <span class="intro-stat-label">Eco-conscious products</span>
        </div>
        <div class="intro-stat">
          <span class="intro-stat-num">10k+</span>
          <span class="intro-stat-label">Happy households</span>
        </div>
        <div class="intro-stat">
          <span class="intro-stat-num">Mon–Fri</span>
          <span class="intro-stat-label">5-day service</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .intro-section {
    background-color: #F8F8F3;
    padding: clamp(88px, 10vw, 128px) 0;
  }
  .intro-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr;
    gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 80px);
    align-items: start;
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .intro-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
  }
  .intro-col-left {
    position: sticky;
    top: 96px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .intro-col-left { position: static; }
  }
  .intro-kicker {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #3a5dff;
    margin: 0 0 14px;
  }
  .intro-h2 {
    font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4.5vw, 52px);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    color: #0f172a;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .intro-body {
    font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.3vw, 18px);
    /* Match NiCE's paragraph: regular weight, tighter line spacing, a more
       neutral grey (was 300 / 1.75 / slate-blue). */
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: rgb(91, 94, 102);
    margin: 0 0 18px;
  }
  .intro-body:last-of-type {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  .intro-stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
  }
  @media (max-width: 540px) {
    .intro-stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; }
  }
  .intro-stat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .intro-stat-num {
    font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(24px, 2.4vw, 30px);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: #0f172a;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .intro-stat-label {
    font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: rgb(71, 85, 105);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
</style>
